    {
      "id": "33660831-05ff-4c42-acc4-5dc720e6d2dc",
      "name": "Template Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -720,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 460,
        "height": 700,
        "content": "### How it works\nThree lanes. (1) Review requests: every day at 6 PM the workflow pulls today's completed jobs from Google Sheets, filters for customers who have not been asked in 90 days, texts them your review link via Twilio, waits 5 days, then sends one gentle reminder if no review appeared. (2) Review monitoring: every 6 hours it polls for new Google reviews; an AI agent drafts a reply to each one, emails the draft to the owner, and queues it in the PendingReplies tab. (3) Post approved replies: every morning at 9 AM it reads the PendingReplies tab and posts the rows the owner marked Approved. Nothing ever posts without human approval.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect your own credentials (every credential slot is a placeholder \u2014 nothing is included): Twilio, Google Sheets, Gmail, plus your Google Business Profile endpoint for the two HTTP nodes.\n2. Fill the three CONFIG nodes: business name, Google review link, owner phone/email, Twilio number, tracker sheet ID.\n3. Create Google Sheets tabs: Jobs, ReviewLog, PendingReplies, State.\n4. Edit both HTTP nodes with your real Google Business Profile endpoint + credentials.\n5. Activate the workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
